1
00:00:05,279 --> 00:00:08,400
Yes, mom.

2
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:10,232
P'Gun.

3
00:00:10,232 --> 00:00:10,732
Yeah?

4
00:00:11,654 --> 00:00:13,688
My mom invited me to eat with her.

5
00:00:16,119 --> 00:00:21,359
At your house?
Mhm.

6
00:00:21,720 --> 00:00:28,400
I'm meeting my friends at 11 p.m.
But we can eat first.

7
00:00:28,400 --> 00:00:34,280
What's that supposed to mean?
It means let's just go.

8
00:00:34,280 --> 00:00:37,724
Then… why did your mom suddenly invite me?

9
00:00:39,685 --> 00:00:47,956
Mhm, I don't know.
Go get ready. I'm doing my report.

10
00:01:07,439 --> 00:01:10,320
Earth, Gun is—

11
00:01:16,080 --> 00:01:22,172
I just got back from his place. He's probably mad that
his dad tried to set him up with some girl.

12
00:01:24,320 --> 00:01:29,799
A girl?
Yeah.

13
00:01:29,799 --> 00:01:32,708
And what do you think about that?

14
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:38,103
Me? Why should I think
anything about it— hey!

15
00:01:44,230 --> 00:01:46,200
Hey, Petch!

16
00:01:46,200 --> 00:01:47,088
Yes?

17
00:01:49,399 --> 00:01:50,585
What can I get for you?

18
00:01:51,675 --> 00:01:54,999
One tower of beer, please.

19
00:01:56,826 --> 00:01:58,975
We're going all night, right bro?
